==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From the Middle English ''[[ransoun]],'' from the Old French ''[[rançon]],'' from the {{etyl|la}} ''[[redemption]]-, [[redemptio-]]'' (see [[redemption]]). Entered English ca. the 13th century

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# [[Money]] paid for the [[free]]ing of a [[hostage]].

====Related terms====
* [[bail]]

